#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:3 a742585133bd4ef7ae60315662039905
msgid "Gimbal Management"
msgstr "云台管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:9 4ddb1dcc91014f2da2846638f1dadab2
msgid ""
"The gimbal module manages any gimbals attached to the autopilot via the RC "
"output ports."
msgstr "gimbal 模块管理通过飞控 RC 输出端口连接的云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:12 2871daf8c0094bc8930838463e3f94da
msgid "A gimbal menu is available on the GUI console."
msgstr "图形控制台上提供云台菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:15 97c73b50e3fc4349820008190a6eb1b5
msgid "gimbal mode"
msgstr "gimbal mode"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:17 9920433d74f14488bd38cdc62d8589f7
msgid "Changes the mode of the gimbal to 1 of 3 options:"
msgstr "将云台切换至以下 3 种模式之一："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:19 578f3d49d0d642628b5637455189e367
msgid "GPS - point to a particular longitude/latitude"
msgstr "GPS — 指向特定经纬度坐标"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:20 4e9b51a802b04a50845402629dcc382d
msgid "MAVLINK - manual control via MAVLink commands"
msgstr "MAVLINK — 通过 MAVLink 命令手动控制"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:21 5463ff5848f34943b220d034db27319a
msgid "RC - manual control via RC channels"
msgstr "RC — 通过 RC 通道手动控制"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:28 c2959734bd834f75ba307f3a075d5308
msgid "gimbal rate ROLL PITCH YAW"
msgstr "gimbal rate ROLL PITCH YAW"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:30 c5bd87315f604651ae6fe0dc53d28484
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum rotational rates (degrees/sec) that the gimbal is "
"limited to. Different rates can be used for different axes."
msgstr "指定云台各轴的最大旋转速率（度/秒），不同轴可使用不同速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:38 eb9336d1bfb7440c8671dc79f4064c09
msgid "gimbal point ROLL PITCH YAW"
msgstr "gimbal point ROLL PITCH YAW"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:40 8a3b9fb243e8496bafa74c842599a7a2
msgid ""
"When in MAVLink mode, tell the gimbal to point in a certain direction. "
"Angles are in degrees."
msgstr "在 MAVLink 模式下，命令云台指向指定方向。角度单位为度。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:48 ed463fb3c1964da786356b71f3b91ba4
msgid "gimbal roi"
msgstr "gimbal roi"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:50 5bcf789ca6f94fe99fc338412be764b1
msgid ""
"When in GPS mode, tell the gimbal to point to a certain location. The "
"location is picked by clicking on the map."
msgstr "在 GPS 模式下，命令云台指向某一位置。位置通过在地图上点击选取。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:58 b371e8e9dd684344b8d8900cf6b8ccb8
msgid "gimbal roivel"
msgstr "gimbal roivel"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:60 933712a5431f421e9e24da07351bc247
msgid ""
"Similar to ``gimbal roi``, but the user is able to specify the maximum "
"velocity and acceleration of the gimbal."
msgstr "与 ``gimbal roi`` 类似，但用户可指定云台的最大速度和加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:69 c092fe74659b4e88a35457c730654ae5
msgid "gimbal status"
msgstr "gimbal status"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/gimbal.rst:71 82fc8dc374df4608a2ad2de2a3cbf37f
msgid "Output the current status of the gimbal."
msgstr "输出云台当前状态。"
